note bottom of InvInventoryCommandServiceImpl
  Atomic receipt consumption: unit validation, available stock,
  pessimistic lock, operationId and Batch usage persistence.
end note
note bottom of RawMaterial
  Legacy Laboratory catalogue is retained.
  New stock operations belong to Inventory.
end note
note bottom of BatchRawMaterialUsageController
  GET retained; legacy POST returns 410.
  New consumption enters through InventoryController.
end note

